{
  "esm": "1.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "AssertionRankMismatchPointwiseOnShaped",
    "description": "Invalid: a pointwise assertion (no `coords`, no `reduce`) on `u`, which is declared with `shape: [\"x\"]` (esm-spec §6.6.5). A whole field has no single trajectory to read; the assertion must select a scalar with `coords`, `reduce`, or an element name. The second assertion, on the element name `u[1]`, is the control and is accepted. Expected error: assertion_rank_mismatch @ /models/TestModel/tests/0/assertions/0.",
